WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,450
I didn't expect that she would be like me

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:03,650
Also an orphan

3
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,650
Don't be sad. I'll scold them for you.

4
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:09,540
No way, no way

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:11,340
Is there anyone who hasn't had steak?

6
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,740
No way, no way

7
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,940
Is there anyone out there who hasn’t even upgraded their wooden house?

8
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,140
No way, no way

9
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,940
Is there anyone who hasn’t grown vegetables?

10
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,940
How to eat so much meat?

11
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:22,740
I can't finish it. I can't finish it at all.

12
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,340
No way, no way

13
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,140
Is there anyone out there who doesn’t have seasoning?

14
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:30,800
Add some chili pepper and a little salt, the taste is enviable

15
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,400
We are not envious at all

16
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,400
That's it, that's it

17
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,600
Yeah, we don't want to eat it at all

18
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,800
It doesn’t taste good at first glance. It’s sour.

19
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:40,450
Unless you send us a few pounds and give us a try, get out of here

20
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:43,930
Senior, thank you for speaking for me

21
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:46,130
There are hundreds of couples in one day and we all
